WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:20.447
"This stinks," Eddy said.

2
00:00:20.448 --> 00:00:24.214
"I don't have a talent!"

3
00:00:24.215 --> 00:00:27.632
"Don't be silly," Poppy said.

4
00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:30.412
"Think, Eddy," Dipper said.

5
00:00:30.413 --> 00:00:40.957
"What do you love to do?"

6
00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:47.319
"I like to go fast," Eddy said.

7
00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:51.012
Just then Zippy drove over.

8
00:00:51.013 --> 00:00:56.341
Zippy laughed. "You're slow."

9
00:00:56.342 --> 00:01:01.016
"Going fast is not your talent!"

10
00:01:01.017 --> 00:01:03.730
Zippy sped off.

11
00:01:03.731 --> 00:01:13.625
"Grr!" Eddy zoomed after Zippy.

12
00:01:13.626 --> 00:01:20.425
They raced around the parking lot.

13
00:01:20.426 --> 00:01:25.634
Then they zoomed back.

14
00:01:25.635 --> 00:01:27.728
Eddy skidded.

15
00:01:27.729 --> 00:01:32.750
"Oh no!" Dipper cried.

16
00:01:32.751 --> 00:01:41.579
Crash! Eddy banged into Dipper.

17
00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:46.053
"Oof!" Dipper cried.

18
00:01:46.054 --> 00:01:48.698
"Sorry!" Eddy said.

19
00:01:48.699 --> 00:01:59.056
"Are you okay?"

20
00:01:59.057 --> 00:02:03.350
"I think so," Dipper said.

21
00:02:03.351 --> 00:02:06.340
She tried to play her music.

22
00:02:06.341 --> 00:02:09.774
But no sound came out.

23
00:02:09.775 --> 00:02:15.529
Dipper gulped.

24
00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:19.849
"My music player broke!"
